scenario:
A developer writes concurrent code to process a list of 10 IDs:
```go
var wg sync.WaitGroup
for _, id := range ids {
    go func(id int) {
        wg.Add(1)
        defer wg.Done()
        fetch(id)
    }(id)
}
wg.Wait()
```
Occasionally, the program exits before all IDs have been fetched, or crashes with a negative counter.

